# 🚨 SYSTEM PROTECTION RULES - HIGHEST PRIORITY

## ABSOLUTE PROHIBITIONS

### ❌ NEVER MODIFY THESE FILES:
- `design-system/src/complete-design-system.css` - GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT
- `design-system/css/design-system.css` - CORE TOKENS - DO NOT EDIT  
- `variables/*.json` - FIGMA EXPORTS - DO NOT EDIT
- `.cursor/rules/button-rules.mdc` - ESTABLISHED RULES - DO NOT EDIT
